OL,3,GNEWSADelays as lorry fire closes major
OL,4,Aroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists are being advised to expect
OL,7,Fdelays after a lorry fire led to
OL,8,Fclosures on a key road in
OL,9,FNottinghamshire.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,Fsaid it was called to attend a vehicle
OL,13,Fon fire at Saxondale Island on the A52
OL,14,Fon Wednesday.
OL,16,FIn a statement, the service said the
OL,17,Ffire was "under control", but warned
OL,18,Froad closures were "expected to
OL,19,Fcontinue for some time".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
