OL,3,GNEWSADelays as lorry fire closes major
OL,4,Aroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways said the A52 was
OL,7,Fclosed westbound between the A46 at
OL,8,FSaxondale and the A6011 in Gamston.
